  "solution": {
    "text": "Total electrons in $\\mathrm{N}_2^{+}=(7 \\times 2)-1=13$\n$\\mathrm{N}_2^{+} \\rightarrow \\sigma_{1 s^2}, \\sigma_{1 s^2}^*, \\sigma_{2 s^2}, \\sigma_{2 s^2}^*,\\left[\\pi_{2p_x}^2=\\pi_{2 p_y}^2\\right] \\sigma_{2 p_z}^1$\nNumber of electron in $\\sigma_{2 p_z}$ is $1$.",
